iga-surface-rigid.out
Rigid motions of curved three-span IGA bending surfaces give zero reactions
StaticStructural nsteps 1 deltat 1.0 maxiter 10 manrmsteps 1 rtolv 1.e-11 rtolf 1.e-11 nmodules 1
errorcheck
domain 2dPlaneStress
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all
ndofman 10 nelem 2 ncrosssect 1 nmat 1 nbc 20 nic 0 nltf 1 nset 10
# Element 1: planar quadratic curve with three knot spans (knots 0 1 2 3, scaled to 0 1/3 2/3 1),
# rotated by 30 degrees about the origin and translated by (0.1, -0.2). Element 2: axisymmetric
# surface of revolution with three knot spans, translated by 0.25 along the axis. The bending
# material has H0 = the reference mean curvature (useh0 1) and no membrane part (gamma1 0), so the
# energy (H - H0)^2 and all reactions stay zero: the current curvature grad F = G x must follow
# the rigid motion on every span (in-plane components) and keep the hoop curvature (axial shift).
node 1 coords 2 0.0 0.0
node 2 coords 2 0.2 0.4
node 3 coords 2 0.5 0.6
node 4 coords 2 0.8 0.3
node 5 coords 2 1.0 0.0
node 6 coords 2 1.0 0.0
node 7 coords 2 1.3 0.3
node 8 coords 2 1.2 0.6
node 9 coords 2 1.4 0.9
node 10 coords 2 1.1 1.2
bsplineplanestrainsurfaceelement 1 nodes 5 1 2 3 4 5 crosssect 1 knotvectoru 4 0 1 2 3 degree 1 2 nip 3 nlgeo 1
bsplineaxisymsurfaceelement 2 nodes 5 6 7 8 9 10 crosssect 1 knotvectoru 4 0 1 2 3 degree 1 2 nip 3 nlgeo 1
simplesurfacecs 1 material 1
surfacetensionmat2 1 gamma1 0.0 omega1 1.0 useh0 1 d 1.0
BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 1 values 1 0.1 set 1
BoundaryCondition 2 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 2 values 1 -0.2 set 1
BoundaryCondition 3 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 1 values 1 -0.12679491924311223 set 2
BoundaryCondition 4 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 2 values 1 -0.15358983848622454 set 2
BoundaryCondition 5 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 1 values 1 -0.26698729810778055 set 3
BoundaryCondition 6 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 2 values 1 -0.030384757729336687 set 3
BoundaryCondition 7 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 1 values 1 -0.15717967697244906 set 4
BoundaryCondition 8 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 2 values 1 0.15980762113533165 set 4
BoundaryCondition 9 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 1 values 1 -0.033974596215561315 set 5
BoundaryCondition 10 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 2 values 1 0.29999999999999993 set 5
BoundaryCondition 11 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 1 values 1 0.0 set 6
BoundaryCondition 12 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 2 values 1 0.25 set 6
BoundaryCondition 13 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 1 values 1 0.0 set 7
BoundaryCondition 14 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 2 values 1 0.25 set 7
BoundaryCondition 15 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 1 values 1 0.0 set 8
BoundaryCondition 16 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 2 values 1 0.25 set 8
BoundaryCondition 17 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 1 values 1 0.0 set 9
BoundaryCondition 18 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 2 values 1 0.25 set 9
BoundaryCondition 19 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 1 values 1 0.0 set 10
BoundaryCondition 20 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 2 values 1 0.25 set 10
ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 1.0
Set 1 nodes 1 1
Set 2 nodes 1 2
Set 3 nodes 1 3
Set 4 nodes 1 4
Set 5 nodes 1 5
Set 6 nodes 1 6
Set 7 nodes 1 7
Set 8 nodes 1 8
Set 9 nodes 1 9
Set 10 nodes 1 10
#%BEGIN_CHECK% tolerance 1.e-10
